<p><span style="font-size:16.0px"><span style="font-family:Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif"><b><u>To be considered for a position with the Division of Blind Services:</u></b><br>
<span style="color:#ff0000"><b>NOTE: All fields in the candidate profile (application) must be completed in its entirety. </b></span><em>Y<span style="color:#ff0000">our packet may be held up at the final review step if you are missing any of the below items.</span></em><br>
